# Build inputs are an allowlist. Local configuration and credentials stay out of
# every stage and exported build cache, even when they are untracked by Git.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!LICENSE
!rust-toolchain.toml
!src/**/*.rs
!modules/*/Cargo.toml
!modules/*/src/**/*.rs
!xtask/Cargo.toml
!xtask/src/**/*.rs
# These scripts are embedded with include_str!, not deployment configuration.
!modules/script/src/context.js
!modules/script/src/json/bridge.js

# These remain excluded even if placed below an allowed source directory.
**/local
**/data
**/target
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
